The weirdest thing happened to me when I tried polypiling in a large shop 
yesterday (nh30j... I have only 1 meg ram *sigh*). 

I accidentally zapped the shopkeeper who happened to bee to close to me.
("Whoops!":) Ms. Tsjernigoff suddenly turned into some tougher @ monster.
I had just had a couple of tough fights and I was really low on hp, so I zapped
her again, hoping that she'd become something less dangerous. This time she
became a steam vortex and engulfed me.

This time she nearly roasted me... only 2 hp left and no healing stuff I 
thought it would be wise to calm her down with some money. So I paid her.

That was a mistake.
She calmed down but I was still in her belly - and I was stuck there! :(
Had no teleport so I tried to move and got "Really attack Ms. Tsjernigoff(yn)?"
*sigh* Then I tried "s" and got "What are you looking for? An exit?"
Then I rested my hp and waited, but she was quite happy with me in her belly...
and was doing good business, I heard the cashmachine sound a couple of times.
(When I had rested enough, I killed her off).

Btw, later in the same game I got this interesting message which I think
I have never seen before... guess what caused it!

	"The very idea of praying to a neutral god is repugnant to you."

